//! Byte-level golden vectors cross-validated against the openppp2 C++
//! reference implementation (ssea.cpp / ITransmission.cpp).
//!
//! The vectors below were produced by a standalone C++ harness that copies
//! the original algorithm code verbatim, so any divergence here means the
//! Rust port drifted from the reference semantics. Regenerate with:
//! `cl /EHsc /O2 tools\vectors.cpp && vectors.exe` (MSVC or any C++ toolchain).

// Data tables below are machine-generated; keep literals verbatim.
// Narrowing casts mirror the generator's int sizes.
